        "Content": "Exclusive new four-bedroom luxury residence extending to approximately 295 sq.m.\r\n\r\nDesigned to achieve an A-rated BER\r\n\r\nSpectacular open-plan kitchen and dining room opening onto the private rear garden\r\n\r\nLuxurious principal suite with private balcony, walk-in wardrobe and dual en-suite bathrooms\r\n\r\nPremium specification including marble kitchens and bathrooms, Gaggenau appliances and Blanco taps with instant boiling and filtered water"
      },
